### ============================================
### SwiftAI ERP - API Test Suite
### Requires: Humao REST Client (VS Code extension)
### Backend:  auth-service (port 8081) + api-gateway (port 8080)
### ============================================

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 2. User Registration
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@company.com",
  "password": "MyPass1234",
  "display_name": "John Lee",
  "company_name": "My Company"
}

### 3. User Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@company.com",
  "password": "MyPass1234"
}

### 4. Get Current User (requires token)
# @prompt token Enter your access_token from login response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. List Roles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Create Role in Role Master
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/role-master
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "role_id": "Z_FINANCE_MGR",
  "description": "Finance Manager - full finance access",
  "role_type": "single",
  "role_category": "finance"
}

### 7. List Role Master
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/role-master
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Role Detail
# @prompt roleId Enter role ID from role-master list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/role-master/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. List Auth Objects
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth-objects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Create Auth Object
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/auth-objects
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "object_class": "finance",
  "object_code": "F_TAX_POST",
  "description": "Post Tax Documents",
  "activities": ["create", "read", "approve"]
}

### 11. Set Auth Values for Role
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/role-auth-values/{{roleId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "auth_object_id": "F_GL_POST",
  "activity_create": true,
  "activity_read": true,
  "activity_approve": true,
  "field_values": {
    "company_code": "1000"
  }
}

### 12. Check Permission
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/permissions/check?object=F_GL_POST&activity=create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
